## 8. API

```python
roster, forms = loadPeForms(jsonPath, cohort="DDS1", excludeStudents=None, sessions=None)
formsDf, itemsDf, adjustDf, dupDf = scorePeForms(forms, sessions=None)
sessDf, progDf, fd = buildPeTables(roster, formsDf, itemsDf, sessions=None, flagConfig=None)
validatePeScoring(formsDf, expected=None)          # → DataFrame calc vs published means
out = buildDds1PeProgressReport(jsonPath="temp 2026 caf.json",
                                outPath="DDS1/DDS1 PE Progress Report.xlsx",
                                cohort="DDS1", subject="DENT90141",
                                excludeStudents=None, flagConfig=None, sessions=None, verbose=True)
# out: dict(roster, formsDf, itemsDf, adjustDf, dupDf, sessDf, progDf)
```

Key columns:

- `itemsDf`: `studentNumber, code, side, itemId, mc, level, denom, pct, optionKey, label`
- `formsDf`: `studentNumber, code, formId, date, assessor, status, subStudent, subAssessor, gr, pr, prof, assessorComment, studentComment, eq, prop, selfEq, selfProp`
- `progDf`: wide `<field>_<code>` columns plus `nScored, meanEq, latestCode, latestEq, latestGr, latestPr, meanZ, zSlope, zChange, selfGap, nSelf, flag, reasons, safety, damageSessions, lowSessions, missingSessions`

Status values: `Scored` (assessor submitted), `Assessor pending` (student only), `Form opened, not submitted`, `No form`.

